menu "Raw receiver diagnostic"
config RAW_SPI_LOCK_ISR_IN_IRAM
    bool "Place SPI bus lock ISR helpers in IRAM"
    default n
    select ESP_SPI_BUS_LOCK_ISR_FUNCS_IN_IRAM
    help
        With heap functions in Flash, pinned IDF 5.5.1 reports an unmet
        SPI_MASTER_ISR_IN_IRAM dependency and does not select these helpers. This option closes their known Flash placement gap only;
        it does not prove the complete interrupt call graph cache safe.
endmenu
